The vertical order is the coding order, and it is deliberately not symmetrical. Legitimacy and equity sit at the same level because neither is a subset of the other: a governance event can be equitable but illegitimate (imposed access conditions without deliberation) or legitimate but inequitable (inclusive deliberation that produces no access pathway). The interaction map makes that independence visible.

